; The deriver: a type's description, written for it. What it writes is
; ordinary code over the library's public combinators, so a derived
; description is one a person could have written by hand.

(library
 (name ppx_wiretype)
 (public_name ppx_wiretype)
 (kind ppx_deriver)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
